('Pairwise collusion on gains','coalition','A linear owner-count separation','For n≥5 owners each eligible for both inputs of min production on the full nonnegative report domain, full outside protection for singletons and pairs requires (n−4)/22≤K_n≤n/2 in the gain budget S+K_nG. Thus the order is Θ(n).','The leading constant is open. Without outside production (payment-only pair TCWM), an owner-independent K is still unresolved.','root/ROOT_ADJUDICATION_40_PAIRWISE_NINETEEN_ROWS.txt'),
